# ── Cycle-demo version ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Run with:  npm run dev:cycle     (or  npm run build:cycle  for a build)
# Every scan shows the NEXT result in the loop — Male → Female → Female
# Pregnant → back to Male — regardless of what the camera sees (even empty
# photos advance the cycle). No server or API needed. The loop lives in
# src/lib/api.ts (cycleStates); edit there to change the cycle.
VITE_CYCLE_MODE=true
